        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "*********THESE PEOPLE ARE GARBAGE*****************\nSTAY AWAY\nI needed to get a tow from montreal to Vaudreuil so i called 5 days in advance, made an appointment and then called the day of to confirm. But when i called just to be sure i was told they forgot me. Okay, but since i called to 'remind them' they said they could still come that night. But they didn't and when I called a 3rd at midnight they said they forget again. This was supposed to be a $350 tow for a appointment at my garage for an inspection to get it registered and these idiots screwed it all up. THEY CANT BE TRUSTED TO SHOW UP THIS IS A TERRIBLE COMPANY",
        "time": 1760502792,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carolyn Gore",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104459222347257949145/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXivms20KOtV7BQIrg5pNDFAmjgPg2-c4jxzhLyrbdaQstUjjlO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "On July 18, 2025, Thierry helped us out during a difficult situation. The vehicle which we were travelling in was broken into while parked in Hudson, Quebec. This vehicle also had a boat trailer attached to it for towing a 24 foot boat, which we were using to travel from Hudson to Montreal. Thierry was called by the owner of the inn that we stayed at in Hudson and he was able to tow the vehicle and trailer to his place of business and store them until our return. He made arrangements with our brother-in-law (who owns the vehicle and trailer and boat) to meet at a boat ramp on a lake close to his place of business. He attached the boat trailer to his tow truck and was waiting for us at the boat ramp. The boat was put on the trailer and he pulled it out of the water. He drove us to his place of business so that my brother-in-law could go to the police station to give a statement about the vandalism on his truck. One of Thierry's employees drove my brother-in-law to the police station and back. Meanwhile, while he was doing that Thierry personally vacuumed out all the tiny hundreds of pieces of glass from the back seat of the vehicle. He even ran his hands over the seats to make sure no glass was embedded. We thanked him profusely for turning a very bad situation to a tolerable one and made our way home.\nI would highly recommend Remorquage Vaudreuil for any of your towing needs. His staff was very courteous and helpful and although we do not speak French, they spoke English with us and were very polite.\nThank you Thierry!",
        "time": 1754676710,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Penelope Moshir",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111598900410064948218/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbEDv9s4ONb0fMj6rJuHQ4rvMyLTjvYpQVc3Z2UoXeMTciKg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Fast response, very polite and helpful. Excellent price, won’t find better pricing, almost half the price of the competitions. Very professional and courteous. Thank you Sedrick for the excellent service.",
